{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261111/photo/bkn-20261111142950763-1111_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261111144310\"/><p>涉事私家車車頭損毀，橫亘路中。</p><p>將軍澳發生交通意外。今午(11日)1時許，一輛私家車駛經駿日街近駿昌街時，失事撞向行人路約1米長鐵欄，私家車車頭撞毀，幸事件中無人受傷。私家車橫亘路中，交通一度受阻。意外原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:54:09.551449+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T06:29:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:28:01.942274+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:47:29.703484+00:00","content_hash":"24fc41c7496e56f22664339dbe787a1af2a17107cac2cda8e95f60aaf68f8ffb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}